# Doom Foretold on turn 1. At Bot2's upkeep Bot2 controls no permanent at all, so it cannot sacrifice and the rest of the
# ability happens in order: Bot2 discards a card (its choice) and loses 2 life, then Bot1 (the controller, not the player
# whose upkeep it is) draws a card, gains 2 life and creates a 2/2 white Knight with vigilance, then sacrifices the
# enchantment. CR 701.21a, 101.2, 608.2c.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Doom Foretold
Swamp
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Forest
Mountain
Swamp
Plains
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
